1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,096
Worked example six point one.

2
00:00:02,096 --> 00:00:09,921
Take oxygen as minus two, potassium plus one, cyanide minus one, and carbon monoxide as neutral.

3
00:00:09,921 --> 00:00:12,122
Permanganate: plus seven.

4
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:17,513
Dichromate: two chromiums share plus twelve, so plus six each.

5
00:00:17,513 --> 00:00:23,385
Ferrocyanide: the complex ion is minus four, so iron is plus two.

